#: ../developer/site-ui.md:1
msgid "Distribution-owned public pages"
msgstr "发行版自有公开页面"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:3
msgid "A deployment can replace the public pages a visitor sees — the landing page, the frame around the account pages, the legal page — without forking the console. The seam is a **build-time UI module**: a small tree of React components that the frontend image compiles in, alongside the shared application rather than instead of it."
msgstr "部署可以替换访客看到的公开页面，包括首页、账号页面外壳和法律条款页，无需 fork 控制台。扩展方式是 **构建时 UI 模块**：前端镜像将一小组 React 组件与共享应用一起编译，而不是用它们替换整个共享应用。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:9
msgid "Most deployments need none of this. If your change is branding, feature flags or copy in the runtime documents, see [configuration.md](configuration.md) and stop here."
msgstr "多数部署无需使用此机制。如果只是修改品牌、功能开关或运行时文档中的文案，请参阅 [configuration.md](configuration.md)。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:13
msgid "1. What a module can and cannot change"
msgstr "1\\. 模块可以修改什么"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "The module owns"
msgstr "模块负责"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "The shared application keeps"
msgstr "共享应用保留"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the home page, if it exports one"
msgstr "模块导出的首页"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the console: dashboard, chat, admin, team, authorize, agents"
msgstr "控制台：dashboard、chat、admin、team、authorize、agents"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the frame around the account pages"
msgstr "账号页面外壳"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the account forms, their fields, validation and submit calls"
msgstr "账号表单、字段、验证与提交请求"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the legal page, if it ships its own text"
msgstr "模块自带正文的法律条款页"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the terms anchors the footer and the sign-up step link to"
msgstr "页脚与注册步骤引用的条款锚点"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "its own wording for the account pages"
msgstr "账号页面的自有文案"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the schemas, error codes, session handling and redirect rules"
msgstr "数据结构、错误码、会话处理与重定向规则"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "its own stylesheet and design assets"
msgstr "自有样式表与设计资源"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the runtime branding document and `/site-config`"
msgstr "运行时品牌文档与 `/site-config`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:23
msgid "A module cannot change who gets in: the account pages' business logic, the registration gate, the email-verification requirement and the permission rules are all in the shared application and are not part of this interface."
msgstr "模块不能改变访问资格：账号页面的业务逻辑、注册开关、邮箱验证要求和权限规则都属于共享应用，不在此接口范围内。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:27
msgid "2. A module is a directory"
msgstr "2\\. 模块是一个目录"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:39
msgid "`client.tsx` exports:"
msgstr "`client.tsx` 的导出项："

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "Export"
msgstr "导出项"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "Required"
msgstr "是否必需"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "What it means"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`descriptor`"
msgstr "`descriptor`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`{ siteUiApi, id, locale }`. The id must match the manifest."
msgstr "`{ siteUiApi, id, locale }`。id 必须与清单一致。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`Landing`"
msgstr "`Landing`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "Rendered at `/`. Supplying one replaces the console's home page."
msgstr "在 `/` 渲染。提供它会替换控制台首页。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`AuthFrame`"
msgstr "`AuthFrame`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "The frame around `/login`, `/signup`, `/forgot-password`, `/reset-password`, `/verify-email`."
msgstr "`/login`、`/signup`、`/forgot-password`、`/reset-password`、`/verify-email` 的外壳。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`TermsFrame`"
msgstr "`TermsFrame`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "Rendered at `/terms` instead of the console's legal text."
msgstr "在 `/terms` 渲染，替代控制台法律条款正文。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`PublicFrame`"
msgstr "`PublicFrame`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "The module's own layout, for the module's own pages. The host never renders it."
msgstr "供模块自身页面使用的布局；宿主不会直接渲染它。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`authAppearance`"
msgstr "`authAppearance`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "Field styling for the shared account forms."
msgstr "共享账号表单的字段样式。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`authMessages`"
msgstr "`authMessages`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "The deployment's wording for the account pages."
msgstr "部署的账号页面文案。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:51
msgid "**An optional export is a claim, not a gap.** `Landing: null` means \"the console's home page is correct here\"; omitting `AuthFrame` means \"the account pages sit inside the console's container\". A module that exports neither is a module that replaced nothing, and that is a legitimate thing to be while it is being written."
msgstr "**可选导出表达的是意图，不是遗漏。** `Landing: null` 表示“这里使用控制台首页”；不提供 `AuthFrame` 表示“账号页面放在控制台容器中”。两者都不导出的模块没有替换任何页面，这可以是模块开发过程中的合理状态。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:57
msgid "**A frame that exists owns the whole page.** `AuthFrame` and `TermsFrame` render their own header, `<main>` and footer, because supplying one is a claim to draw the page. A frame that draws only a card leaves five pages with no chrome — that is not a styling choice the host can correct, so it is the first thing to get right."
msgstr "**提供外壳就代表负责整张页面。** `AuthFrame` 和 `TermsFrame` 需要绘制自己的页头、`<main>` 与页脚，因为提供它们就意味着接管页面。如果外壳只绘制一张卡片，五个页面就会失去外层框架。宿主无法替模块纠正这种布局选择，因此首先要确保这一点。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:63
msgid "3. Building an image with a module"
msgstr "3\\. 使用模块构建镜像"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:65
msgid "The official frontend Dockerfile takes the module as a Buildx named context:"
msgstr "官方前端 Dockerfile 通过 Buildx 命名上下文接收模块："

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "Input"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`site-ui` context"
msgstr "`site-ui` 上下文"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the built-in marker"
msgstr "内置标记"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "no external module; the neutral UI"
msgstr "没有外部模块，使用默认 UI"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`SITE_UI_SUBDIR`"
msgstr "`SITE_UI_SUBDIR`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`.`"
msgstr "`.`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the module's directory inside the context"
msgstr "上下文中的模块目录"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`SITE_UI_API`"
msgstr "`SITE_UI_API`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "unset"
msgstr "未设置"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "required with an external module; must be `1`"
msgstr "使用外部模块时必填，必须为 `1`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:91
msgid "Passing the whole `frontend/` tree as the context and naming the module with `SITE_UI_SUBDIR=site-ui` lets a distribution keep the module *and* its build tooling in one input tree, so the version lock describes the same set of inputs."
msgstr "将整个 `frontend/` 树作为上下文，并通过 `SITE_UI_SUBDIR=site-ui` 指定模块，可让发行版把模块 *以及* 构建工具放在同一输入树中，使版本锁描述同一组输入。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:96
msgid "An external context that carries no module **fails the build**. Falling back to the neutral UI would publish a site whose home page reverted, and nothing in the build log would say so."
msgstr "外部上下文未包含模块时，**构建会失败**。不能悄悄回退到默认 UI，否则发布的首页会变回控制台页面，构建日志却毫无提示。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:100
msgid "Local development"
msgstr "本地开发"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:102
msgid "The same staging step runs on a workstation, without Docker. Run a gateway first and set `BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` to its address if it is not `http://backend:8080`; the existing runtime `/site-config` dependency is unchanged:"
msgstr "同一暂存步骤也可在工作站运行，无需 Docker。请先启动网关；若地址不是 `http://backend:8080`，则设置 `BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL`。应用对运行时 `/site-config` 的依赖保持不变："

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:116
msgid "`SITE_UI_DIR` and `SITE_UI_API` name the module directly if you would rather not stage a copy:"
msgstr "如果不想暂存副本，可以用 `SITE_UI_DIR` 和 `SITE_UI_API` 直接指定模块："

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:124
msgid "The variables above apply to that one command; no shell profile is changed. To return to the neutral UI, stop the server and run:"
msgstr "上述变量仅作用于当前命令，不会修改 shell 配置。若要恢复默认 UI，停止服务器后执行："

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:131
msgid "Local dev serves module assets via `SITE_ASSETS_DIR`; the image recipe packages them automatically."
msgstr "本地开发通过 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` 提供模块资源；镜像配方会自动打包这些资源。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:134
msgid "The staging environment file is used by the Dockerfile, not automatically read by npm. Leaving a staged directory behind does not select it for later commands."
msgstr "暂存环境文件由 Dockerfile 使用，npm 不会自动读取。保留暂存目录不会让之后的命令自动选择该模块。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:137
msgid "Either way the resolver writes `src/site-ui/active/` and `tsconfig.generated.json`, so the bundler, the type checker and the test runner all read the same decision. Those files are generated; do not edit them."
msgstr "无论采用哪种方式，解析器都会写出 `src/site-ui/active/` 与 `tsconfig.generated.json`，让打包器、类型检查器和测试工具使用同一选择。这些文件由工具生成，请勿手工编辑。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:141
msgid "4. Assets"
msgstr "4\\. 资源"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:143
msgid "A module's images live in `public/site-assets/<module-id>/`, and the build merges them into the image. Three rules, all enforced:"
msgstr "模块图片位于 `public/site-assets/<module-id>/`，构建时会合并进镜像。以下三条规则均由工具强制执行："

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:146
msgid "**Under the module's own id.** An asset elsewhere fails the build. This is what makes \"two modules cannot write the same path, and neither can shadow the application's\" true."
msgstr "**资源必须位于模块自身 id 下。** 放在其他路径会使构建失败，从而保证不同模块不能写入同一路径，也不能覆盖应用资源。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:149
msgid "**Never a collision.** A module asset at a path the application already ships fails the build rather than overwriting it."
msgstr "**不允许冲突。** 模块资源与应用已有路径冲突时构建失败，不会静默覆盖。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:151
msgid "**The route is what serves them.** `/site-assets/*` is a Next route handler, and a route handler shadows static file serving for the whole prefix — so \"the file is in `public/`\" is not evidence that it is reachable. Test the URL."
msgstr "**资源由路由提供。** `/site-assets/*` 是 Next 路由处理器，会覆盖整个前缀的静态文件服务。因此，“文件位于 `public/`”不能证明它可访问，必须实际请求 URL。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:155
msgid "At runtime, `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` is read first and the image's own copy second. A deployment that mounts its branding directory keeps overriding the module's files, and one that mounts nothing still serves a complete site."
msgstr "运行时先读取 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR`，再回退到镜像内的副本。挂载品牌目录的部署可以继续覆盖模块资源；未挂载目录的部署也有完整站点。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:159
msgid "5. Styling the shared forms"
msgstr "5\\. 共享表单的样式"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:161
msgid "The shared account forms render their own markup and default styling. Stable semantic hooks provide styles and state; a narrow layout slot provides structural variation. The older class map remains a temporary compatibility mechanism."
msgstr "共享账号表单拥有自己的结构和默认样式。稳定的语义属性用于样式与状态；精简的布局槽位支持结构差异。旧的样式类映射暂时保留以兼容现有模块。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:165
msgid "**`data-auth` attributes for styling and state.** Shared form elements expose:"
msgstr "**用于样式与状态的 `data-auth` 属性。** 共享表单元素提供："

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "On"
msgstr "所在元素"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`data-auth=\"form\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"form\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the `<form>`"
msgstr "`<form>` 元素"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`data-auth=\"field\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"field\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "each field's wrapper"
msgstr "每个字段的外层元素"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`data-auth=\"label\"` / `\"control\"` / `\"password-control\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"label\"` / `\"control\"` / `\"password-control\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "label and inputs"
msgstr "标签与输入框"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`data-auth=\"reveal\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"reveal\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the show-password button"
msgstr "显示密码按钮"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`data-auth=\"hint\"` / `\"error\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"hint\"` / `\"error\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the hint and the error paragraph"
msgstr "提示与错误段落"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`data-auth=\"notice\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"notice\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "an error or success notice"
msgstr "错误或成功提示"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`data-auth=\"submit\"` / `\"field-action\"` / `\"secondary-actions\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"submit\"` / `\"field-action\"` / `\"secondary-actions\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the buttons and links"
msgstr "按钮与链接"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`data-auth=\"consent\"` / `\"consent-section\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"consent\"` / `\"consent-section\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the sign-up confirmations"
msgstr "注册确认项"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "`data-auth=\"loading\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"loading\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:0
msgid "the resolving-session region"
msgstr "会话解析中的区域"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:179
msgid "State is carried by the attributes the application already sets — `aria-invalid`, `disabled`, `aria-busy`, `data-auth-error` — so a stylesheet never has to infer \"this field is in error\" from a class name. The set is part of the contract: an attribute is added, never repurposed."
msgstr "状态由应用设置的现有属性表达，包括 `aria-invalid`、`disabled`、`aria-busy` 和 `data-auth-error`。样式表无需根据类名猜测字段是否出错。这组属性属于契约：可以新增，但不能改变已有属性的含义。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:184
msgid "**Structural layout.** The optional `fieldLayout` receives the shared control, hint, error and action nodes, and the label's text and `htmlFor` id. It must render every supplied node, associate the label with that id, and preserve the `data-auth=\"field\"` and `data-auth=\"label\"` hooks. The neutral layout places the field action after the control and validation; a module may place it beside its label. This replaces layout booleans without moving validation or controllers into a distribution."
msgstr "**结构布局。** 可选的 `fieldLayout` 接收共享控件、提示、错误与操作节点，以及标签文本和 `htmlFor` id。它必须渲染所有传入节点，将标签关联到该 id，并保留 `data-auth=\"field\"` 和 `data-auth=\"label\"` 属性。默认布局将字段操作放在控件与验证信息之后；模块可以将其放在标签旁边。这种方式替代布局布尔值，同时让验证与控制器继续留在共享应用中。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:192
msgid "**Transitional `authAppearance` class map.** The existing class-map export is retained to let current modules migrate without changing their visual design. It is deprecated and is not a frozen v1 styling surface. New styling should use scoped `data-auth` and state selectors; class names are module-owned details. The semantic-style migration is not complete: the class map and its nested `fieldLayout` entry will remain available until the existing consumer has migrated and normal, invalid, loading and keyboard states have been compared. Removing them requires a documented migration and API revision; callers are not expected to track unannounced breaking changes."
msgstr "**过渡期的 `authAppearance` 样式类映射。** 目前保留该导出，以便现有模块在不改变视觉设计的情况下迁移。它已弃用，不是冻结的 v1 样式接口。新样式应使用限定作用域的 `data-auth` 与状态选择器；类名是模块自身的实现细节。语义样式迁移尚未完成：在现有消费者完成迁移，并对照正常、非法输入、加载与键盘操作状态之前，类映射及其嵌套的 `fieldLayout` 入口会继续保留。移除它们需要明确的迁移文档与 API 版本变更，调用方无需跟随未公告的破坏性改动。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:202
msgid "All customization is subject to the same rule: **the module's CSS may only affect the pages it owns.** A stylesheet that reaches `body`, `:root` or a bare element selector will restyle the console too, and no check will catch it for you — scope everything under a root class the module sets on its own shell."
msgstr "所有定制都遵循同一条规则：**模块 CSS 只能影响模块负责的页面。** 选择 `body`、`:root` 或裸元素的样式会同时改变控制台，目前没有检查器替你拦截。应将所有规则限定在模块外壳设置的根类名之下。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:207
msgid "6. Compatibility"
msgstr "6\\. 兼容性"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:209
msgid "**Adding a module does not change the console.** The five account pages sit in the console container when no `AuthFrame` is exported, and the shared pages, schemas and session handling are untouched either way."
msgstr "**添加模块不会改变控制台。** 未导出 `AuthFrame` 时，五个账号页面留在控制台容器中；无论是否提供模块，共享页面、数据结构与会话处理都保持不变。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:212
msgid "**Removing an optional export is safe.** A module that stops exporting `Landing` gets the console's home page back."
msgstr "**移除可选导出是安全的。** 模块停止导出 `Landing` 后，将恢复控制台首页。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:214
msgid "**Renaming or removing an export, changing a prop's meaning, or repurposing a `data-auth` value is a breaking change** and belongs behind an API revision bump. So does renaming a key in `authMessages` or changing its interpolation variables."
msgstr "**重命名或删除导出、改变属性含义，或改变 `data-auth` 值的用途，均属于破坏性变更**，需要提升 API 版本。重命名 `authMessages` 的键或改变其插值变量也一样。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:218
msgid "**Adding an optional key or attribute is compatible.**"
msgstr "**新增可选键或属性是兼容变更。**"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:220
msgid "`SITE_UI_API` is the version of this document. The resolver refuses a module that declares a revision this checkout does not implement, rather than building something neither side was written for."
msgstr "`SITE_UI_API` 是本文定义的接口版本。模块声明的版本若不受当前 checkout 支持，解析器会拒绝构建，而不会产生双方都未准备支持的产物。"

#: ../developer/site-ui.md:224
msgid "The optional server `locale` is currently consumed by the document root. Server metadata exports are reserved and are not applied by the host; module authors should not rely on them to change titles or descriptions."
msgstr "服务端可选的 `locale` 当前由文档根节点使用。服务端 metadata 导出是预留能力，宿主目前不会应用；模块作者不应依赖它修改标题或描述。"
